<title>USA: Carriage Services completes transactions.</title>
<headline>Carriage Services completes transactions.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Carriage Services Inc on Monday said it completed four acquisitions for a total of $50 million.</p>
<p>The company said the deals involved CNM, a California corporation that owns and operates funeral homes in Alameda and Contra Costa counties in California, as well as in Richmond, Calif.</p>
<p>Carriage owned and operated 91 funeral homes and 11 cemeteries in 17 states as of January 13.</p>
